:Namespace Db
⍝ The only code that knows about SQAPL. Values always travel as bind
⍝ variables; text is declared wide, (W) in and (Q) out, so Unicode survives.

    ∇ Connect;Env;conn
      'SQA'⎕CY'sqapl'
      Env←{2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' ⍵}
      {}SQA.Init''
      conn←'Driver={PostgreSQL Unicode};Server=',(Env'PGHOST'),';Port=',(Env'PGPORT'),';Database=',Env'PGDATABASE'
      Check SQA.Connect'C1' ''(Env'PGPASSWORD')(Env'PGUSER')('DriverOptions'conn)
    ∇

    ∇ rows←Do args;r
    ⍝ args: 'SQL with :<C1000(W): or :<I: markers' value1 value2 ...
      r←SQA.Do(⊂'C1'),⊆args
      Check r
      rows←⊃3⊃r
    ∇

    ∇ ns←Doc args;rows
    ⍝ For queries whose one column is a JSON document; ⍬ when no row
      rows←Do(⊂(⊃⊆args),' :>C1000000(Q):'),1↓⊆args
      ns←{0=≢⍵:⍬ ⋄ ⎕JSON⊃⍵}rows
    ∇

    ∇ Check r;state
    ⍝ SQL errors are signalled with EN 500 and the SQLSTATE as message.
    ⍝ A lost connection ends the process; compose restarts the worker.
      →0/⍨0≥⊃r
      state←{4=⊃⍵:⊃2⊃⍵ ⋄ 'APL',⍕2⊃⍵}r
      :If '08'≡2↑state
          ⍞←'Lost database connection (',state,'), exiting',⎕UCS 10
          ⎕OFF 1
      :EndIf
      ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 500)('EM' 'SQL ERROR')('Message' state)
    ∇

:EndNamespace
